# The PC's own data never goes into this repository (paper trading only; the Kalshi key never leaves the PC).
# This file is the repository's .gitignore (kept here as cloud/repo.gitignore so the PC's copy documents it).
/paper.db
/live.db
/backups/
/logs/
# research data stays on the PC, except PLAN5 L's samples: GitHub Actions collects them here since 2026-10-28 (public
# Kalshi market data only). The PC's "moved" marker never goes in: it would stop the hourly job.
/research/data/*
!/research/data/lip/
/research/data/lip/MOVED.txt
/dashboard.html
/marks.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pem
*.key
.kalshi/
/research/results/freshness.*
